msgctxt "712"
msgid ""
"Our store's a wreck right now, but we're not going to go out of business!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "Hello, sir. What can I do for you today?"
msgstr "Buongiorno, signore. Cosa posso fare per lei oggi?"

msgctxt "736"
msgid "Actually, I'm good."
msgstr "A dire il vero, sono a posto."

msgctxt "748"
msgid "Okay, just let me know if you change your mind."
msgstr "Va bene. Fammi sapere se cambi idea."

msgctxt "760"
msgid "Tell me about Jewel."
msgstr "Parlami di Jewel."

msgctxt "772"
msgid "What would you like to know about Jewel?"
msgstr "Cosa ti interessa sapere di Jewel?"

msgctxt "784"
msgid "Tell me about Jewel itself."
msgstr "Parlami di Jewel in sé."

msgctxt "796"
msgid ""
"Jewel is a hostess club with a  laid-back atmosphere and friendly, down-to-"
"earth girls."
msgstr ""
"Jewel è un hostess club con un'atmosfera rilassata e ragazze simpatiche e "
"alla mano."

msgctxt "808"
msgid "It's my top recommendation! You can find it over on Shichifuku St."
msgstr "È la mia raccomandazione di punta! Lo trovi lì su Shichifuku Street."

msgctxt "820"
msgid ""
"There's an 8,400 yen cover charge, a 3,150 yen hostess-selection charge, and"
" a 3,150 yen service charge."
msgstr ""
"C'è un costo d'ingresso di 8.400 yen, una quota di 3.150 yen per la "
"selezione dell'hostess, e una quota di servizio di 3.150 yen."

msgctxt "844"
msgid "Tell me about Miyu Shiraboshi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid ""
"Miyu-chan has a gentle personality. She's a goddess with intense eyes and "
"soothing, charming presence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "Just between us, I hear she's a single mother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid ""
"She's 27, a Virgo, and her blood type's B! Her favorite food is sushi and "
"she hates spicy stuff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid ""
"Hehehe... Ask for Miyu-chan, and I guarantee you'll be soothed beyond your "
"wildest dreams!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid "Tell me about Shiori Nagamori."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid "Shiori-chan's a laid-back free spirit who's quick to make friends."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid ""
"She's the kind of girl who marches to the beat of her own drum, if you know "
"what I mean."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid ""
"If she tells you something's \"like, whatever,\" don't take it personally. "
"She just speaks her mind⑬she really does care deep down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid "She's 22, an Aquarius, and her blood type's O!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid ""
"Heheheh... Watch out, or you might just get hooked on Shiori-chan's "
"easygoing charm!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid "Tell me about Yui Hatano."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid "Yui-chan's a very independent woman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid "She's cheerful and positive and super fun to hang out with!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid ""
"Though she does have an ever-growing number of men who fall for her and "
"start showering her with gifts..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid ""
"Her blood type is A, she's a Gemini, and she loves grilling meat, though "
"she's not a fan of the fatty kind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1060"
msgid "Hehehe... Yui-chan's free-spirited nature might just steal your heart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1084"
msgid "Tell me about Shine."
msgstr "Parlami di Shine."

msgctxt "1096"
msgid "What would you like to know about Shine?"
msgstr "Cosa ti piacerebbe sapere di Shine?"

msgctxt "1108"
msgid "Tell me about Shine itself."
msgstr "Che mi dici di Shine?"

msgctxt "1120"
msgid "Shine is a long-standing hostess club in Kamurocho."
msgstr "Shine è uno storico hostess club a Kamurocho."

msgctxt "1132"
msgid ""
"The manager scouts the girls himself, so there's not a butterface among "
"them. You'll find it over on Pink St."
msgstr ""
"Il gestore seleziona le ragazze di persona, quindi non ce n'è una che sia "
"una ciofeca in viso. Lo troverai su Pink Street."

msgctxt "1144"
msgid ""
"There's an 8,400 yen cover charge, a 3,150 yen hostess-selection charge, and"
" a 3,150 yen service charge."
msgstr ""
"C'è un costo d'ingresso di 8.400 yen, una quota di 3.150 yen per la "
"selezione dell'hostess, e una quota di servizio di 3.150 yen."

msgctxt "1168"
msgid "Tell me about Reimi Hanayama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1180"
msgid "Reimi-chan is a caring girl who's loyal and kindhearted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1192"
msgid ""
"I'd have to say she's always the most sought-after hostess at all the clubs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1204"
msgid "If anyone could be called queen of the night, it would be her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1216"
msgid "Rumor has it the owner of club Shine stole her from another club."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1228"
msgid ""
"She's 24, a Capricorn, and her blood type's A! I hear she loves to shop and "
"can't stand sushi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1240"
msgid ""
"Hehehe... Reimi-chan's a challenge, all right! After all, she "
"<Italic>is</Italic> the number one hostess in all of Kamurocho!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1264"
msgid "Tell me about Rin Sasaba."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1276"
msgid "Rin-chan is one tough girl who tells you exactly what's on her mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1288"
msgid "Men can't get enough of her thick Osaka accent and sharp wit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1300"
msgid ""
"She's 25, a Capricorn, and her blood type's A! I warn you, unlike most "
"hostesses, Rin-chan doesn't drink at all. Don't forget."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1312"
msgid ""
"Hehehe... Once you get a taste of that sharp Osaka-fed wit of hers, you'll "
"be completely hooked!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1336"
msgid "Tell me about Kana Momonogi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1348"
msgid "Kana-chan's a real cutie who's pure of heart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1360"
msgid ""
"Tired of life in Tokyo, she left to relax in the countryside for a while, "
"but came back not too long ago. Her innocent aura has made her quite popular"
" at the club!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1372"
msgid ""
"Her blood type is AB, and she's a Capricorn! She loves to eat, but I hear "
"she won't go near sushi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1384"
msgid ""
"Hehehe... You won't be able to get her out of your mind once you get a taste"
" of her pure-hearted goodness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1408"
msgid "Tell me about Ranko Yazuki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1420"
msgid "Ranko-chan can be summed up in one word: cool."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1432"
msgid ""
"She loves the nightlife, and she spends her weekends clubbing with a huge "
"group of friends."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1444"
msgid ""
"She's got a tattoo on the left side of her chest. It's pretty cool, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1456"
msgid ""
" She's 21, a Taurus, and her blood type's O! She loves perfume and hates "
"things that smell bad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1468"
msgid "Hehehe... Her sultry, sexy voice will take you to heaven."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1492"
msgid "Tell me about Love in Heart massage parlor."
msgstr "Parlami del centro massaggi Love in Heart."

msgctxt "1504"
msgid "That's a popular massage parlor on Senryo Avenue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1516"
msgid "They offer two types of massages to soothe your tired body."
msgstr "Offrono due tipi di massaggi per dare sollievo al tuo corpo stanco."

msgctxt "1540"
msgid "Tell me about Fusion video store."
msgstr "Parlami della videoteca Fusion."

msgctxt "1552"
msgid "It's a store over on North Senryo Avenue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1564"
msgid "They offer private rooms where you can watch \"special\" videos."
msgstr "Offrono salette private dove puoi guardare 'video speciali'."

msgctxt "1588"
msgid "Tell me about Bantam bar."
msgstr "Dimmi un po' del Bantam bar."

msgctxt "1600"
msgid "It's a bar east of Millennium Tower."
msgstr "È un bar a est della Millennium Tower."

msgctxt "1612"
msgid ""
"As you no doubt know, it's been the scene of many different⑬how shall I "
"say⑬incidents."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1624"
msgid ""
"But nowadays, it's a much more fun place to hang out in. You can even play a"
" game of darts there, if you're feeling up to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1648"
msgid "Tell me about Asia bikini bar."
msgstr "Parlami di Asia bikini bar."

msgctxt "1660"
msgid "It's over on Pink St. and has been there almost forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1672"
msgid ""
"There's a dancer there, Emi-chan, who's super popular. You've only got to "
"see her in action to understand why."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1696"
msgid "Tell me about Earth Angel bar."
msgstr "Che mi dici del bar Earth Angel?"

msgctxt "1708"
msgid "It's a bar in the Champion District."
msgstr "È un vecchio bar nel Champion District."

msgctxt "1720"
msgid "One of their girls, Ako-chan, is practically famous around here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1732"
msgid "It's well worth a visit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1756"
msgid "Tell me about Shellac bar."
msgstr "Che mi dici del Shellac bar?"

msgctxt "1768"
msgid "It's an old bar in the Champion District."
msgstr "È un vecchio bar nel Champion District."

msgctxt "1780"
msgid ""
"It's a bit cramped but still comfortable. I hear it has quite the share of "
"regulars."
msgstr ""
"È un po' stretto, ma comunque comodo. Ho sentito dire che ha un bel po' di "
"clienti fissi."

msgctxt "1792"
msgid ""
"It also has an impressive lineup of booze, all carefully selected by the "
"owner."
msgstr ""
"Ha anche una gamma impressionante di alcolici, tutti attentamente "
"selezionati dal proprietario."

msgctxt "1816"
msgid "Tell me about Shangri-La."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1828"
msgid "It used to be the hottest place in Japan..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1840"
msgid "...Well, it was, until that incident there four years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1864"
msgid "Could I get someone to show me how to get there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1888"
msgid ""
"It seems you have someone waiting for you. You probably shouldn't keep them "
"waiting."
msgstr "Pare che ti aspetti qualcuno. Non è il caso di farli aspettare."

msgctxt "1900"
msgid "Where to, sir?"
msgstr "Dove la porto, signore?"

msgctxt "1912"
msgid "Take me to Shine."
msgstr "Portami a Shine."

msgctxt "1924"
msgid "Shine, the hostess club?"
msgstr "Shine, il locale per hostess?"

msgctxt "1936"
msgid "Yeah, that's the one."
msgstr "Ah sì, proprio quello."

msgctxt "1948"
msgid "Take me to Jewel."
msgstr "Portami al Jewel."

msgctxt "1960"
msgid "Jewel, the hostess club?"
msgstr "Jewel, l'hostess club?"

msgctxt "1972"
msgid "Yeah, that's the one."
msgstr "Ah sì, proprio quello."

msgctxt "1984"
msgid "Take me to Love in Heart."
msgstr "Portami a Love in Heart."

msgctxt "1996"
msgid "Love in Heart, the massage parlor?"
msgstr "Love in Heart, il centro massaggi?"

msgctxt "2008"
msgid "Yeah, that's the one."
msgstr "Ah sì, proprio quello."

msgctxt "2020"
msgid "Take me to Asia."
msgstr "Portami ad Asia."

msgctxt "2032"
msgid "Asia, the bikini bar?"
msgstr "Asia, il bikini bar?"

msgctxt "2044"
msgid "Yeah, that's the one."
msgstr "Ah sì, proprio quello."

msgctxt "2056"
msgid "Of course, sir. Just a moment, please."
msgstr "Certo, signore. Solo un momento, prego."

msgctxt "2068"
msgid "Hello? This is MEB calling. How are you this evening?"
msgstr "Pronto? Qui è MEB che chiama. Come sta questa sera?"

msgctxt "2080"
msgid "Um, yes, I have a guest here who'd like to come by now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2092"
msgid "So we're good? Great! Thank you!"
msgstr "Allora, siamo a posto? Grande! Grazie!"

msgctxt "2104"
msgid "Okay, sir, please follow me. I'll take you there right away."
msgstr "Certo, capo, mi segua pure. La porto subito."

msgctxt "2176"
msgid "I'm sorry, sir, but you, um... You seem to be a little short on cash."
msgstr ""
"Mi dispiace, signore, ma lei, uh... Sembra che sia un po' a corto di soldi."

